IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0007.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY SHP0007C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 F-AM               PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM WEIGHT-PRICING
    DISPLAY "F-AM=" F-AM
    STOP RUN.
WEIGHT-PRICING.
    IF PW-KG <= 2
        MOVE 5 TO F-AM
    ELSE IF PW-KG LESS THAN OR EQUAL TO 20
        MOVE 12 TO F-AM
    ELSE
        COMPUTE F-AM ROUNDED = PW-KG * 1.50
    END-IF
    END-IF.
